{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_123_title", "source_sha256": "dfd806a2a88f8e6919c4805890ad98cdd3fe84e68c4e9308045c5dcf58e844d7", "ja": "ねぇ。キミにとって……", "zh": "我说。对你来说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_123_synopsis", "source_sha256": "bb5161b00966607b21e690534d4574ea97704590f9c7e776885719221623e276", "ja": "忙しいと知りつつも、プロデューサーとすれ\r\n違う日々が続きヤキモキした莉緒。本当は自\r\n分の事をどう思っているのか問いただすもの\r\nの、答えを聞いた結果、今はまだ曖昧な関係\r\nを楽しもうと考えるのだった。", "zh": "明明知道制作人很忙，却因为持续错身而过的日子而焦急不已的莉绪。虽然她追问了对方究竟是怎么看待自己的，但在听到答案之后，她还是决定先享受现在这层暧昧的关系。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_123_1000_p", "source_sha256": "fd8218f795e4b9e51e917f56a82224216e87d632c8bf132b3f84b7bba65131ea", "ja": "（莉緒の公演が無事に終わった。ただ、打ち上げは特別\nな場所でって言ってたけど……どういうことなんだ？）", "zh": "（莉绪的公演顺利结束了。不过，她说庆功宴要在一个特别的地方举行……到底是怎么回事？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_123_1001_046rio", "source_sha256": "61b0a042faedc5a7939ed0a85ee747b599bd2ee583b23629ff65475c2f59769e", "ja": "{$P$}くん、お待たせっ。\n着替えが終わったら、早速行きましょうか？", "zh": "{$P$}，久等啦。\n换好衣服后，我们就马上出发吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_123_1002_p", "source_sha256": "197ff1f5beee61fbb4e61e189b5f2c945cbd1795b8efbbc2c9fc8428ae0865b2", "ja": "ああ、俺は構わないけど……。\n俺と莉緒だけで、本当にいいのか？", "zh": "啊，我倒是没问题……不过，真的只让莉绪和我去，没关系吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_123_1003_002chi", "source_sha256": "b70f238270cc88453141ef5cda1a2cbf72303393abfee42fb891c9d775feaa42", "ja": "はい、もう聞いています。今日の主役は百瀬さんです\nから、私たちのことは気にしないでください。", "zh": "好的，我已经听说了。今天的主角是百濑小姐，\n所以请不用在意我们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_123_1004_021mat", "source_sha256": "8cbf924a518d15ab858a528fbd3f36abd1816cf859dba9d1b13bd2781e46c49e", "ja": "今は莉緒ちゃんとの時間を優先するのです。\nちゃんとエスコートしなきゃ、めっ！なのですよ？", "zh": "现在要优先陪莉绪的时间哦。不好好护送她可不行，不可以哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_123_1005_046rio", "source_sha256": "571b07abcf165422db7cc65e6c83df036c65cdb8171b847140a87a64b194da98", "ja": "ふふっ、そういうこと！\nみんな、今夜は彼を借りちゃうけど、ごめんね♪", "zh": "呵呵，这样才对嘛！\n大家，今晚我要借用他一会儿，抱歉啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_123_1006_045kar", "source_sha256": "c452a558a04979c0d80795326e76816c42c41ef0d48faffec287bb6c27339690", "ja": "わっ……。な、なんだか、\n大人の会話って感じがします……！", "zh": "哇……总、总觉得，这是大人之间的对话……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_123_1007_027say", "source_sha256": "80d383379ffe124bebd4c2b03fb5ac7f9dd9b765286d8f902c7d5c971230cd4c", "ja": "やっぱり{$P$}と何か……\nあっ、ダメダメ！　私、また変なこと言ってる！", "zh": "果然和{$P$}有什么……\n啊，不行不行！我怎么又在说奇怪的话了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_123_1008_p", "source_sha256": "447b01465803b28cb31f772a6cc1799e0338fbeead0eb7136303a1ab1bd227a6", "ja": "微妙に話が見えないけど……\n莉緒、テレビ収録の時に何かあったのか？", "zh": "我有点没太听懂你在说什么……\n莉绪，电视录制的时候发生什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_123_1009_046rio", "source_sha256": "954b157f6773a5333091c0de069734a8d23ceb844c6fd7c55cfd9ce834d74563", "ja": "細かいことはいーの！　キミも早く準備してね。\nとっておきのお店に連れていくんだから♪", "zh": "细节就不用在意啦！你也快点准备好。\n我可是要带你去一家很棒的店呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_123_1010_p", "source_sha256": "67a04057fe14dbe2d9f9817e03795bd2d43a0839b7fda8351160a0a81c5f06cc", "ja": "（とっておきのお店、というと……？）", "zh": "（说到特别的店……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_123_1011_p", "source_sha256": "a66012f8bb9f4fb5a1a34991b30bfe2b5482c8e7126b0ecaaebbb013cb4428cc", "ja": "いやいや、いつもお世話になってる居酒屋じゃないか！\n特別な場所っていうから、もっとこう……。", "zh": "不是不是，这不就是我们平时常去的居酒屋吗！既然你说是特别的地方，我还以为会更……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_123_1012_046rio", "source_sha256": "1168c70d798f373b12713f22dba6f8671e05e383e075cacf6ef690a683ed40e9", "ja": "なによー、特別でしょ？　なんたって、　\n私とキミが初めて会ったところなんだから。", "zh": "干吗呀——，这不是很特别吗？毕竟，  \n这里可是我和你第一次见面的地方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_123_1013_046rio", "source_sha256": "4b52d5f890c95dd4e199518395aa7c3e9f08f3e11f065f6ed9a511fdac8661a0", "ja": "みんなに無理を言ってキミを借りちゃったのも、\nここで二人っきりになるためなんだぞ☆　ウフフ♪", "zh": "我还拜托大家，把你借过来了，就是为了能在这里和你独处☆　呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_123_1014_p", "source_sha256": "800e74360fa4fa600a148078d2440679ac883eecd9147935baec40db2d1db516", "ja": "え？　ということは……。\nもしかして、なにか大事な話でも……あるのか？", "zh": "诶？也就是说……难道是有什么重要的事……要和我说吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_123_1015_046rio", "source_sha256": "2b132d23c39801842556e7f73eb8b4c456f1b5cf21e822368697c848f962c01b", "ja": "大事な話？　別にないけど？", "zh": "要紧的事？并没有啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_123_1016_p", "source_sha256": "57507a98ef678f5798af45cc5e349777786b41f0f0b66929870b0cb130cc9813", "ja": "な、ないのか！？　今の会話は何かこう、\n大事な話がある流れだったと思うんだけど……！", "zh": "没、没有吗！？我还以为刚才的对话，是在往“有重要的事要说”这个方向发展呢……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_123_1017_046rio", "source_sha256": "5c970f361543fb1356c9f4f974ddd5c48e935171088004d7d817ac43615fa60f", "ja": "違うわよー。これといって大事な話はないけど……\n私は他愛もない話を、キミとたくさんしたかったのっ。", "zh": "不是啦——。虽然没什么特别重要的事……我只是想和你聊很多无关紧要的小事嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_123_1018_046rio", "source_sha256": "c6d54affec0a1a2a9b9d1f37af915a90ee4aa9176dfdcffa08341810f1e00a7d", "ja": "最近どんな曲聞いてるのーとか、\n私にどんなアイドルになってほしいのーとか？", "zh": "比如最近在听什么歌啦，\n希望我成为什么样的偶像啦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_123_1019_046rio", "source_sha256": "c58296f6184ee7ecb0f6f11a046b134df4dc2afe877f5354bdf0a7acb60eb531", "ja": "そういう話を、無事に公演が終わった後に\nたまには二人っきりで、ゆっくりと。……ね？", "zh": "那些话，等公演顺利结束后，偶尔就我们两个人，慢慢聊聊。……好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_123_1020_p", "source_sha256": "2db0275942b1afe4be198584fb24461091362ffe5dfd014276700a8ddb451498", "ja": "ああ、なるほど、そういうことか……。\nなら、たしかにこのお店がぴったりかもな。", "zh": "啊，原来是这么回事……。\n这么说来，这家店确实再合适不过了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_123_1021_046rio", "source_sha256": "36a7b4138a58f803ee9c3703e794c59969b68b3ba3e84d54a0e5218ae3765c7c", "ja": "でしょでしょ♪　じゃあ、最初はビールでいいわよね？\nすみませーん、とりあえず生ビール二つで！", "zh": "对吧对吧♪那就先来啤酒，没问题吧？\n不好意思——先来两杯生啤酒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_123_1022_046rio", "source_sha256": "f253898748d23fc1110121c23c85a4ae2b401b1a658e7d28a8a594231afffb25", "ja": "返事くれなかった分、たっぷり話してもらうわよ？\n今夜は寝かさないぞっ♪　なーんてねっ、ウフフ♪", "zh": "既然你没回我的消息，就好好陪我聊个够吧？今晚可不让你睡哦♪……开玩笑的啦，呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
